LASS MicrogravityHealthProblems : GlobalEffect {\n  This: -3* MC / (Colony MAX 5 - Influence)\n}\n\nCLASS MartianProtectionism : GePartyDistant<MarsFirst>, GePartyCurrent<Unity> {\n  HAS Class<VenusTag>\n  Current<This>:: PendingGlobalEffect<Current<This>, Class<VenusInfrastructure>>\n}\n\nCLASS VenusInfrastructure : GlobalEffect {\n  This: 2 MC / VenusTag MAX 5, 2 MC / Influence\n}\n\nCLASS TitanVenusAlliance : GePartyDistant<Unity>, GePartyCurrent<Reds> {\n  HAS Class<VenusTag>, Class<Colony>\n  Current<This>:: PendingGlobalEffect<Current<This>, Class<CloudSocieties>>\n}\n\nCLASS CloudSocieties : GlobalEffect {\n  This IF StartToken: EACH @ResourceCard<Class<Floater>, Anyone> { Floater<@ResourceCard> BY Admin }\n  This: Floater<ResourceCard<Class<Floater>>> / Influence\n}\n\nCLASS ImmigrationToVenus : GePartyDistant<Kelvinists>, GePartyCurrent<Greens> {\n  HAS Class<VenusTag>, Class<Colony>\n  Current<This>:: PendingGlobalEffect<Current<This>, Class<CorrosiveRain>>\n}\n\nCLASS CorrosiveRain : GlobalEffect {\n  This: (-2! Floater OR -10* MC) THEN ProjectCard / Influence\n}\n",
