          "bundles/promos/classes.pets" to
              "\"Installs attack history for cards that use it\"\nCLASS AttackHistoryWatcher : CardWatcher {\n  This: EACH @Class<Resource> { ResourceRemovalWatcher<@Class> }\n  This: EACH @Class<StandardResource> { ProductionDecreaseWatcher<@Class> }\n}\n\n\"A durable generational resource-removal record owned by the victim and naming the attacker\"\nCLASS ResourceWasAttacked<Class<Resource>, Player, GenerationScope> : Owned, System\n\n\"A durable generational production-decrease record owned by the victim and naming the attacker\"\nCLASS ProductionWasAttacked<Class<StandardResource>, Player, GenerationScope> : Owned, System\n\nCLASS ResourceRemovalWatcher<Class<@Resource>> : System {\n  HAS MAX 1 This\n  -X @Resource<Victim@Owner(NOT Attacker@)> BY Attacker@Player: ResourceWasAttacked<Victim@, Class<@Resource>, Attacker@>*\n}\n\nCLASS ProductionDecreaseWatcher<Class<@StandardResource>> : System {\n  HAS MAX 1 This\n  -X Production<Victim@Owner(NOT Attacker@), Class<@StandardResource>> BY Attacker@Player: ProductionWasAttacked<Victim@, Class<@StandardResource>, Attacker@>*\n}\n",
